Synthetic REST answers (decision 0009). Nothing in this directory was received from Hibachi or
belongs to an account.

- Every file is hand-built in the shapes Hibachi publishes for GET /market/exchange-info (its
  Market API spec and SDK) and GET /market/data/funding-rates (as the public Java library reads
  it); README.md cites the source of each field.
- The contract ids, statuses, ticks, steps, minimum sizes and notionals, decimals, granularities,
  timestamps, fee rates, withdrawal limits, funding rates and index prices are made-up inputs,
  except the ETH/USDT-P contract's id, decimals, tick, step, granularities and margin rates and
  its marketCreationTimestamp, which are the public example values of api-doc.hibachi.xyz and
  the SDK's test data, and EUR/USDT-P's id, decimals, tick and step, which are the public Java
  library's test values.
- No file holds an account id, an address, a key or any other key-shaped value: feeConfig's
  instantWithdrawDstPublicKey, a key-shaped field of the published examples, is left out.
- No value was measured from Hibachi's live feeds or history.

This marker covers fixtures/hibachi/rest/ only. Recorded Hibachi answers never go here.
